      "duration_s": 3.58
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line017.mp3",
      "text": "That\u2019s because you were holding a fork.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 2.83
    },
    {
      "type": "play_stinger"
    },
    {
      "type": "skit_boundary"
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line018.mp3",
      "text": "If we got offered the pills, I\u2019d want to talk it through first.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 3.98
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line019.mp3",
      "text": "Even if the whole world were a simulation?",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 3.34
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "B",
      "file": "audio/line020.mp3",
      "text": "Especially then. I\u2019d want you beside me while we figure out what\u2019s real.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 5.42
    },
    {
      "type": "play_audio",
      "actor": "A",
      "file": "audio/line021.mp3",
      "text": "Good. I\u2019d bring snacks, a notebook, and one spoon we both agree is a spoon.",
      "laugh": false,
      "duration_s": 6.12
